      ],
      "message": "ci: Add -Wno-error=maybe-uninitialized to i686 and Alpine musl tasks\n\nGCC 15 at -O1 reports a false -Wmaybe-uninitialized for a\nstd::optional<btck::Logger<...>> in test_kernel.cpp, in the destructor\nof a logger that is always emplaced before use. Don't fail the build on\nit, as the armhf task already does.\n\nThis change was written with Claude Opus 5.5.",
      "committer": {
